    <item>
      <title>Connecting the Dots Between Roy Lichtenstein and Today</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/08/arts/design/roy-lichtenstein-like-new-review-whitney.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/08/arts/design/roy-lichtenstein-like-new-review-whitney.html</guid>
      <atom:link href="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/08/arts/design/roy-lichtenstein-like-new-review-whitney.html" rel="standout"></atom:link>
      <description>The Whitney’s retrospective is full of jokes, but it captures our image overload with surprising tenderness. Our critic calls it “the most momentous exhibition of the season.”</description>
      <dc:creator>Jason Farago</dc:creator>
      <pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 12:35:18 +0000</pubDate>
